// Author the suffix coordinate the pinned query reads, so the row written into
// the `--at` fixture's own commit binds a suffix hint rather than inheriting
// one from another import. `sys.blob.annotate` binds a media type and the hint
// that media type's own MIME-1 entry declares, so the pair is always the
// canonical one (audio/wav -> wav).
sys.blob.annotate(sys.blob.capture_file(__MEDIA_ROOT__, "tone.wav", 65536), "audio/wav", "wav")
